{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51317","headline":"酬张二十员外（《全唐诗》二四二张继《江上送客游庐山》诗後） · 窦叔向","name":"酬张二十员外（《全唐诗》二四二张继《江上送客游庐山》诗後）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空（此诗原缺出处，应出《文苑英华》卷二四三，题作《酬张二十员外前成长子博士叔向》，署「张继」，《全唐诗》据以收於张继名下，岑仲勉《唐人行第录》考证此应爲窦叔向诗，张二十即张继。\n此诗题应作《酬张二十员外》，「前国子博士叔向」爲附收入张作时之署名。\n後人不明唐集附收之例，因误作张诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦叔向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}